# SPA fallback.
#
# The router reads `location.pathname`, so a deep link to /editor has to reach index.html
# rather than the host's 404 — otherwise the one URL worth sharing is the only one that
# breaks when shared. Cloudflare Pages reads this file verbatim.
#
# 200, not 301: the browser must keep the URL it was given so the router can route on it.
/*    /index.html   200
